cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it and record the exact Git commit. Cite original methodological publications for comparator methods as well."
type: software
title: "StrataSCAN: Adaptive Density-Stratified Clustering and Reference Baselines"
authors:
  - name: "StrataSCAN contributors"
version: "0.2.4"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/VEK239/StrataSCAN"
url: "https://github.com/VEK239/StrataSCAN/tree/v0.2.4"
abstract: >-
  Installable Python implementations and adapters for StrataSCAN, DBSCAN,
  HDBSCAN, OPTICS, SNN-DBSCAN, VDBSCAN, AMD-DBSCAN, kNN-DBSCAN,
  kNN plus Leiden, X-shift, and an automatic DPC-kNN hybrid.
  Includes executable protocols and recorded evidence for adaptive
  density-stratified clustering on sparse nearest-neighbor graphs.
keywords:
  - clustering
  - density-based clustering
  - variable-density clustering
  - nearest-neighbor graphs
  - density peaks clustering
  - StrataSCAN
  - DBSCAN
  - HDBSCAN
  - OPTICS
  - SNN-DBSCAN
  - VDBSCAN
  - AMD-DBSCAN
  - kNN-DBSCAN
  - Leiden
  - X-shift
  - DPC-kNN
